      "message": "Since this patch is checked in aosp, and more partners will be impacted, so I would like to understand the above behavior is the one we expect before we proceed. Apologize if you have explained it in other meetings / conversations before.\n\nThe above behavior is what I interpreted from CLs in topic `angle_selection_refactor_1`. Since the default ANGLE apk is not taken out yet, we can put aside the question of \"ANGLE apk not available\". Would you mind checking if `persist.graphics.egl` is ANGLE, below behaviors are correct?\n\n\"default\": use ANGLE binary in /vendor.\n\"angle\": use ANGLE apk.\n\"native\": use ANGLE binary in /vendor. (EGL Loader.cpp will read persist.graphics.egl first before ro.hardware.egl)",
